He's working on a book about the science morbid curiosity to be published next year. Dr. Skrivenor, thank you for joining me today. Hi, Kim. Thank you for having me on. So how do you define morbid's curiosity? You've developed a scale to measure it. What kinds of things do you ask about? Yeah, that's a good question,

5
