12
00:06:53.000 --> 00:07:13.000
we kind of tow that line, right? And we're partly at the whims of the narrator of the creator of the game. And when things get too scary and we get pushed too much into that imaginary world, we perform certain actions that help draw us back in. So for example, in some of the studies I've done, we found that people will actually suppress their fear

