Like something bad will eventually happen. And if you've never experienced fear before or anxiety before, in a safe setting, you're going to feel really unprepared for it and you're going to be really surprised and shocked to not know how to handle those kinds of feelings. And so, you know, these kind of scary play or adventurous play or risky or thrilling play,

